nventory/wastage."},{"given":"The requested wastageRatio is valid.","id":"AC-1.12","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200 and the returned wastageRatio value equals the saved submitted value.","when":"A client sends PATCH /inventory/settings."},{"given":"Inventory data exists and a supported horizon and valid wastageRatio are supplied.","id":"AC-1.13","level":"api","then":"Each response status is 200 and each returned outlook contains the requested horizon, wastageRatio, and per-item current stock, daily estimated consumption, and projected balance fields.","when":"A client sends GET /inventory/outlook for each supported horizon: daily, weekly, monthly, quarterly, bi-annual, and annual."},{"given":"Ration records exist or the ration list is empty.","id":"AC-1.14","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200 and the returned rations list contains records with the contract ration and ingredient fields, including identity, type, target weight range, operational status, costPerLb, and ingredients.","when":"A client sends GET /rations."},{"given":"Every ingredient item exists and the ration request is valid.","id":"AC-1.15","level":"api","then":"The response status is 201 and the returned ration record includes its identity, type, target weight range, operational status, ingredients, and calculated costPerLb.","when":"A client sends POST /rations."},{"given":"Inventory ingredients are available and the optimization constraints are valid.","id":"AC-1.16","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200 and the returned feasibleCandidates and infeasibleCandidates contain feasibility, ingredient mix, costPerLb, predicted dry matter, and predicted energy fields in the contract cost order.","when":"A client sends POST /rations/optimize."},{"given":"The requested candidateId exists and is available for selection.","id":"AC-1.17","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200 and the returned selectedCandidate matches the requested candidate and the applied fiel